  "title": [
    "[Evermore Hotel, Bar]"
  ],
  "description": [
    "On both sides of an archway leading to the foyer, ornate sconces hang between paintings on emerald-papered walls above dark-stained wainscoting.  A line of padded stools covered in cognac-hued leather welcome patrons to a long ebony bar fitted with a brass kickplate in front.  Reflected in a wall-length mirror positioned behind the well-stocked bar, groupings of oversized leather chairs around low tables offer more intimate conversation."
  ],
